       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          SVENLABL.
       AUTHOR.              BK DISMUKES.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        JAN 12, 1993.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *D REMARKS.             PRINTS VENDOR LABELS DEFINED BY
      *D                      TVENLABL.
      *C
      *C APR 15, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C THIS PROGRAM WAS NOT LINING UP THE LABELS PROPERLY.
      *C THE PROGRAM NOW ASSUMES THAT THE MCPRT FILE IS SET UP
      *C FOR 8 LINES PER INCH AND 96 LINES PER PAGE. CHANGED THE
      *C CODE SO THAT THE ADDRESS LINES ARE NOW LINED UP AND
      *C DON'T CREEP ANYMORE. (NO CHANGES WERE MADE TO THE HP
      *C VERSION.)  ALSO REPLACED THE UNNEEDED COPYLIB CALLS
      *C WITH THE ACTUAL CODE.
      *C
      *C JUNE 8, 1999   CA YODER
      *C CHANGED CODE FOR LABEL SIZE 1 X 3.5 TO PRINT 5 LINES
      *C PER LABEL.  UNION CITY REPORTED PROBLEM WITH LABELS
      *C NOT LINING UP PROPERLY.
      *C
      *C OCTOBER 8, 2003   CA YODER
      *C FIXED PROBLEM WITH START OF DVENDOR.  WAS STARTING FILE
      *C EQUAL TO VEN-ARG OF "0000000000".  HOWEVER, IF THIS V/C
      *C DIDN'T EXIST, THE PROGRAM WOULDN'T RUN.  CHANGED START
      *C TO >= INSTEAD OF = VEN-ARG.
      *C
      *C OCTOBER 14, 2003  CA YODER
      *C FIXED PROBLEM CERTAIN VENDOR CODES BEING SKIPPED.  CHANGED
      *C START OF DVENDOR TO VEN-ARG OF SPACES INSTEAD OF ALL ZEROES.
      *C THIS WAY, VENDOR CODES THAT START WITH ALPHABETIC CHARACTERS
      *C WILL NOT BE SKIPPED.
      *C

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  AS-400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  AS-400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.          I-O-FEEDBACK     IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                               LOCAL-DATA       IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA
                               C01 IS NEW-PAGE.


       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT SORT-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.
           SELECT ONLINE-PRT ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.

           SELECT DVENDOR-VN-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       SD  SORT-FILE
           RECORD CONTAINS 15 CHARACTERS.
       01  SORT-RCD.
           05  SORT-DETAIL.
               10  SORT-CODE          PIC X(10).
               10  SORT-ZIP           PIC X(5).

       FD  ONLINE-PRT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS PRINT-REC.
       01  PRINT-REC               PIC X(132).

      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
       FD  DVENDOR-VN-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DVENDOR-VN-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0700  OF MCFLCS0701.

      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       77  SUB                        PIC 9(2)  VALUE 0.
       77  SUB2                       PIC 9(2)  VALUE 0.
       77  VEN-SUB                    PIC 9(2)  VALUE 0.
       77  LABEL-COUNT                PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
       77  LABEL-SIZE                 PIC S9(2) VALUE 0.
       77  AVAIL-LINES                PIC S9(2) VALUE 0.
       77  LABEL-LINE                 PIC S9(2) VALUE 0.
       77  ADDR-LINE                  PIC S9(2) VALUE 0.
       77  FIND-NEXT                  PIC S9(1) VALUE 0.
       77  PRESENT-VEND               PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.

       01  STAT-BUFF.
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(3).
           05  STAT-BUFF-2            PIC X(1).
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(6).

       01  TERM-TYPE                  PIC X(5).

       COPY ESCNAM2 IN COPYLIB.

       01  NO-PERF                      PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  PERF-BACK                    PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.

      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **             D A T E / T I M E   A R E A S                **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************

       01  MDY-DATE.
           05  MM-IN          PIC XX.
           05  FILLER         PIC X.
           05  DD-IN          PIC XX.
           05  FILLER         PIC X.
           05  YY-IN          PIC XX.

       01  YMD-SHORT.
           05  YY-SHORT      PIC XX.
           05  MM-SHORT      PIC XX.
           05  DD-SHORT      PIC XX.

       01  TIME-SAVE.
           05  HRS-SAVE       PIC XX.
           05  MIN-SAVE       PIC XX.
           05  SEC-SAVE       PIC XX.

      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **         E R R O R   M E S S A G E   A R E A S            **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************

       COPY TBLOWUP  IN COPYLIB.
       COPY COMMAND  IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CCHKOBJ  IN COPYLIB.
       COPY OVRPFDAT IN COPYLIB.

      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **       C O M M U N I C A T I O N S   A R E A S            **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************

       01  SPOOLER-AREA.
           05  SPOOL-STAT           PIC S9     VALUE ZEROS BINARY.
           05  SPOOL-PRT            PIC S9(2)  VALUE ZEROS BINARY.
           05  SPOOL-COPIES         PIC S9(2)  VALUE 1 BINARY.
           05  SPOOL-PRIOR          PIC S9     VALUE ZEROS BINARY.
           05  SPOOL-MSG            PIC X(75)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  SPOOL-LIMIT          PIC S9(8) BINARY VALUE 60000.
       01  SPOOL-FEQ-NAME       PIC X(8)  VALUE "SXXXXXXX".


       01  VIEW-COMAREA.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(118) VALUE ALL "0".
           05  FILLER                PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 9999.


      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **           D A T A B A S E   W O R K                      **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

       COPY DATAB IN COPYLIB.

       01  DB-DATASETS.
           05  DSET-NAME           PIC X(16)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  DSET-DVENDOR        PIC X(16)  VALUE "DVENDOR;".

       01  ITEM-LISTS.
           05  ALL-ITEM-LIST          PIC XX   VALUE "@;".
           05  CODE-SEARCH            PIC X(10) VALUE "CORP-CODE;".

      *
      * FIELDS USED BY 920-FIND-POSITION PARAGRAPH
      *
       01  TOTAL-LENGTH                  PIC S9(3) VALUE 44 BINARY.
       01  FIND-POSITION.
           05  CHAR-POS OCCURS 44 TIMES  PIC X.

       01  PRINT-POSITION                PIC S9(3) BINARY.

      *
      * SAVE FIELDS USED IN PRINTING VENDOR ADDRESS
      *
       01 SAVE-VENDOR-CODE               PIC X(10).
       01  SAVE-ZIP-LOC-FLAG             PIC X.
           88  SAVE-ZIP-BEFORE-CITY    VALUE "1".
           88  SAVE-ZIP-AFTER-COUNTRY  VALUE "2".
       01  SAVE-ZIP                      PIC X(09).
       01  SAVE-STATE-CODE               PIC X(02).
       01  SAVE-PROV-CODE                PIC X(04).
      *

      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **           D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S                **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************

       COPY DVENDOR OF COPYLIB.


      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **               K S A M   W O R K                          **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************

       01  VEN-ARG                       PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
       01  KEY-LOC                       PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 3.
       01  KEY-LENGTH                    PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 8.
       01  RECSIZE                       PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 66.
       01  RELATIONAL-OPERATOR           PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 2.
       01  RESULT                        PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZEROS.


      ***************************************************************
      **                                                           **
      **               D A T A   L I S T                           **
      **                                                           **
      ***************************************************************
       01  DATA-LINE-1.
           05  DATA1-PRINT-OPTION      PIC X(2).
           05  DATA1-FORM-SIZE         PIC X.
           05  DATA1-SORT-OPTION       PIC X.
           05  DATA1-SELECT-OPTION     PIC X.
           05  DATA1-LOW-VALUE         PIC X(12).
           05  DATA1-HIGH-VALUE        PIC X(12).

       01  ACCEPT-VEND-CODE.
           05  A-CODE                  PIC X(10).
           05    FILLER                PIC X(70).

       01  TABLE-VEND-CODE.
           05  ITEM-ENTRIES  OCCURS 48 TIMES.
               10  VEND-CODE-ITEM      PIC X(10).

      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **       H E A D E R   &   D E T A I L   L I N E S          **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************

       01  PRINT-VENDOR-LABEL.
           05  VENDOR-INFO       OCCURS 9 TIMES.
             10  PRT-VEND-INFO       PIC X(44) VALUE SPACES.
           05  BLANK-LINE            PIC X(44) VALUE SPACES.



       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1-HOUSEKEEP SECTION.
       1-HOUSEKEEPING.
           MOVE "10" TO BU-DISPLAY-PARA.
           CALL "TESCSEQ" USING ESC-NAME.

           MOVE PERF-SKIP-ON TO PERF-BACK.
           MOVE PERF-SKIP-OFF TO NO-PERF.

           PERFORM 9999-OPEN-STUFF.

           DISPLAY
           "INPUT PRT OPT, FORM SIZE, SORT OPT, SELECT, LOW, HIGH".
           DISPLAY "PPFSSLLLLLLLLLLLLHHHHHHHHHHHH".
           ACCEPT DATA-LINE-1.
           DISPLAY "PRINT-OPTION  = ", DATA1-PRINT-OPTION.
           DISPLAY "FORM-SIZE     = ", DATA1-FORM-SIZE.
           DISPLAY "SORT-OPTION   = ", DATA1-SORT-OPTION.
           DISPLAY "SELECT-OPTION = ", DATA1-SELECT-OPTION.
           DISPLAY "LOW-VALUE     = ", DATA1-LOW-VALUE.
           DISPLAY "HIGH-VALUE    = ", DATA1-HIGH-VALUE.
           IF DATA1-SELECT-OPTION = "3"
               PERFORM 4-VEND-CODE-INPUT THRU 4-VCI-X.

           MOVE "14" TO BU-DISPLAY-PARA.
           IF DATA1-SORT-OPTION = "1"
                   SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-ZIP
                                                   SORT-CODE
                        INPUT PROCEDURE IS 6-INPUT-CODES
                        OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 8-WRITE-LABELS
           ELSE
           IF DATA1-SORT-OPTION  = "2"
               IF DATA1-SELECT-OPTION = "3"
                   SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-CODE
                                                   SORT-ZIP
                        INPUT PROCEDURE IS 6-INPUT-CODES
                        OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 8-WRITE-LABELS
               ELSE
                   PERFORM 10-CKREAD-LABELS THRU 10-CL-X
           ELSE
               MOVE "INVALID SORT KEY ENTERED" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE DATA1-SORT-OPTION          TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               GO TO 2100-BLOWUP.

           PERFORM 9999-CLOSE-STUFF.
           GOBACK.


       2100-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "SVENLABL" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
               BU-DISPLAY-AREA.

       3-STOP-SPOOL.
           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM PERF-BACK AFTER ADVANCING 0.
           PERFORM 9971-STOPSPOOL.
           CLOSE ONLINE-PRT.

       4-VEND-CODE-INPUT.
           MOVE "12" TO BU-DISPLAY-PARA.
           MOVE ZERO TO SUB2.
           PERFORM UNTIL SUB2 > 48 OR A-CODE = "0000000000"
               ADD 1 TO SUB2
               DISPLAY "INPUT VEND CODE, '0000000000' TO END"
               ACCEPT ACCEPT-VEND-CODE
               IF A-CODE NOT = "0000000000"
                   MOVE A-CODE TO VEND-CODE-ITEM (SUB2)
                   DISPLAY "ADDING ", A-CODE, " TO TABLE"
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM.
           MOVE ZERO TO SUB2.
       4-VCI-X.
           EXIT.

       5-PRINT-LABEL.
           MOVE "60" TO BU-DISPLAY-PARA.

           IF DATA1-FORM-SIZE = "1"
               MOVE 6  TO LABEL-SIZE
               MOVE 5  TO AVAIL-LINES
           ELSE
           IF DATA1-FORM-SIZE = "3" OR "4"
9404CK         MOVE 16 TO LABEL-SIZE
9404CK         MOVE 15 TO AVAIL-LINES
           ELSE
9404CK         MOVE 8 TO LABEL-SIZE
9404CK         MOVE 7 TO AVAIL-LINES.

9404CK     MOVE 0 TO LABEL-LINE, ADDR-LINE.
  .        PERFORM UNTIL ADDR-LINE = 9
  .          OR ADDR-LINE = AVAIL-LINES
  .             ADD 1 TO ADDR-LINE
  .             IF PRT-VEND-INFO (ADDR-LINE) NOT = SPACES
  .                WRITE PRINT-REC FROM PRT-VEND-INFO (ADDR-LINE)
  .                      AFTER ADVANCING 1
  .                ADD 1 TO LABEL-LINE
  .             END-IF
  .        END-PERFORM.
  .        PERFORM UNTIL LABEL-LINE = LABEL-SIZE
  .            ADD 1 TO LABEL-LINE
  .            WRITE PRINT-REC FROM BLANK-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1
  .        END-PERFORM.
  .
  .   *    ADD 1  TO  LABEL-COUNT.
  .   *    IF LABEL-COUNT = 20
9404CK*        WRITE PRINT-REC FROM NO-PERF AFTER ADVANCING 0.

           MOVE SPACES    TO PRINT-VENDOR-LABEL.

       5-PL-X.
           EXIT.

       6-INPUT-CODES.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
      *****MOVE "0000000000"  TO VEN-ARG.
           MOVE SPACES        TO VEN-ARG.
           IF DATA1-SELECT-OPTION = "3"
               ADD 1 TO SUB2.
           PERFORM 60-FIND-DATA THRU 6-IC-X.

       60-FIND-DATA.
           IF DATA1-SELECT-OPTION = "3"
               MOVE SPACES TO VEN-ARG
               PERFORM UNTIL (VEN-ARG NOT = SPACES) OR (SUB2 > 48)
                   IF VEND-CODE-ITEM (SUB2) NOT = SPACES
                       MOVE VEND-CODE-ITEM (SUB2) TO VEN-ARG
                   END-IF
                   ADD 1 TO SUB2
               END-PERFORM
               IF (SUB2 > 48) OR (VEN-ARG = "0000000000")
                   GO TO 6-IC-X
               END-IF
           ELSE
           IF DATA1-SELECT-OPTION = "2"
              IF DATA1-LOW-VALUE NOT = SPACES
                 MOVE DATA1-LOW-VALUE TO VEN-ARG.

           PERFORM 9999-CHAINHD-DVENDOR-VN-I.
      *    CALL "DBFIND" USING BASE, DSET-DVENDOR, MODE1,
      *           STATUS-AREA, VEN-SEARCH, VEN-ARG.

       60-MOVE-DATA.
           MOVE SPACES TO    SORT-CODE, SORT-ZIP.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DVENDOR-VN-I.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
               GO TO 6-IC-X.

           IF DATA1-SELECT-OPTION = "2"
               IF VEN-VEN-CODE > DATA1-HIGH-VALUE
                   GO TO 6-IC-X.

           IF VEN-ITM-NO = 7
               MOVE VEN-ZIP             TO SORT-ZIP
               MOVE VEN-VEN-CODE        TO SORT-CODE
               RELEASE SORT-RCD
               MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD
               IF DATA1-SELECT-OPTION = "3"
                   GO TO 60-FIND-DATA.

           GO TO 60-MOVE-DATA.

       6-IC-X.
           EXIT.

       8-WRITE-LABELS SECTION.
       8-START-SPOOL.
           MOVE "40" TO BU-DISPLAY-PARA.
           MOVE DATA1-PRINT-OPTION TO SPOOL-PRT.
           PERFORM 9970-STARTSPOOL.

           OPEN OUTPUT ONLINE-PRT.
           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM NO-PERF AFTER ADVANCING 0.
       81-RETURN-SORT.
           RETURN SORT-FILE AT END
               PERFORM 3-STOP-SPOOL
               GO TO 8-WL-X.

       82-FIND-VENDOR.
           MOVE SORT-CODE TO VEN-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CHAINHD-DVENDOR-VN-I.
      *    CALL "DBFIND" USING BASE, DSET-DVENDOR, MODE1, STATUS-AREA,
      *           VEN-SEARCH, VEN-ARG.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
               GO TO 81-RETURN-SORT.
           DISPLAY "VENDOR CODE -" VEN-ARG
           MOVE 0 TO VEN-SUB.

       82-GET-LABEL-LOOP.
           ADD 1 TO VEN-SUB.
           IF VEN-SUB > 9
               MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-VENDOR-LABEL
               GO TO 81-RETURN-SORT.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DVENDOR-VN-I.
      *    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-DVENDOR, MODE5, STATUS-AREA,
      *        ALL-ITEMS, BUF-DVENDOR, VEN-ARG.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
               GO TO 81-RETURN-SORT.
           IF VEN-ITM-NO = 0
               MOVE 1 TO VEN-SUB.
           IF VEN-ITM-NO < 7
               MOVE VEN-ITM-DATA TO PRT-VEND-INFO (VEN-SUB)
               GO TO 82-GET-LABEL-LOOP
           ELSE
           IF VEN-ITM-NO = 7
               DISPLAY "PRINTED VENDOR CODE -" VEN-VEN-CODE
      *
      * 920-FIND-POSITION RETURNS THE POSITION TO PRINT THE NEXT ITEM
      * IN PRINT-POSITION
      *
                   IF ZIP-BEFORE-CITY

      *
      * ZIP CITY
      *
                     SET SAVE-ZIP-BEFORE-CITY TO TRUE
                     MOVE VEN-ZIP TO FIND-POSITION
                     PERFORM 920-FIND-POSITION
                     STRING VEN-CITY
                       DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO FIND-POSITION
                       WITH POINTER PRINT-POSITION
                     MOVE VEN-STATE-CODE TO SAVE-STATE-CODE
                     MOVE VEN-PROV-CODE TO SAVE-PROV-CODE

                   ELSE

      *
      * CITY STATE PROVINCE
      *
                     SET SAVE-ZIP-AFTER-COUNTRY TO TRUE
                     MOVE VEN-CITY TO FIND-POSITION
                     PERFORM 920-FIND-POSITION
                     STRING VEN-STATE-CODE
                       DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO FIND-POSITION
                       WITH POINTER PRINT-POSITION
                     PERFORM 920-FIND-POSITION
                     STRING VEN-PROV-CODE
                       DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO FIND-POSITION
                       WITH POINTER PRINT-POSITION
                     MOVE VEN-ZIP TO SAVE-ZIP

                   END-IF
                   MOVE FIND-POSITION TO PRT-VEND-INFO (VEN-SUB)
                   GO TO 82-GET-LABEL-LOOP

           ELSE
           IF VEN-ITM-NO > 7
             IF SAVE-ZIP-BEFORE-CITY

      *
      * STATE PROV COUNTRY
      *
               MOVE SAVE-STATE-CODE TO FIND-POSITION
               PERFORM 920-FIND-POSITION
               STRING SAVE-PROV-CODE
                 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO FIND-POSITION
                 WITH POINTER PRINT-POSITION
               PERFORM 920-FIND-POSITION
               STRING VEN-COUNTRY
                 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO FIND-POSITION
                 WITH POINTER PRINT-POSITION

             ELSE

      *
      * COUNTRY ZIP
      *
               MOVE VEN-COUNTRY TO FIND-POSITION
               PERFORM 920-FIND-POSITION
               STRING SAVE-ZIP DELIMITED BY SIZE
                 INTO FIND-POSITION WITH POINTER PRINT-POSITION

             END-IF
           MOVE FIND-POSITION TO PRT-VEND-INFO (VEN-SUB)
           PERFORM 5-PRINT-LABEL THRU 5-PL-X
           GO TO 81-RETURN-SORT.

       8-WL-X.
           EXIT.


       10-CKREAD-LABELS SECTION.
       10-CKREAD-LABELS-PARA.
      **************************************************************
      **   NOTE THAT THE "SPOOL2631STRT2" SUBROUTINE IS USED      **
      **   INSTEAD OF "SPOOL2631START".  THE "STRT2" ALLOWS US    **
      **   TO SPECIFY A FILE LIMIT FOR THE SPOOL-FILE, WHICH      **
      **   NORMALLY HAS A LIMIT OF 5000 RECORDS.  SINCE THIS      **
      **   REPORT COULD PRINT OVER 5000 RECORDS, WE USE "STRT2"   **
      **   TO SPECIFY A HIGHER LIMIT (40,000 RECORDS).            **
      **************************************************************

           MOVE "70" TO BU-DISPLAY-PARA.
           MOVE DATA1-PRINT-OPTION TO SPOOL-PRT.
           PERFORM 9970-STARTSPOOL.
           OPEN OUTPUT ONLINE-PRT.

           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM NO-PERF AFTER ADVANCING 0.

      *****MOVE "0000000000"   TO VEN-ARG, PRESENT-VEND.
           MOVE SPACES         TO VEN-ARG, PRESENT-VEND.
           IF DATA1-SELECT-OPTION = "2"
              IF DATA1-LOW-VALUE NOT = SPACES
                 MOVE DATA1-LOW-VALUE TO VEN-ARG.

           PERFORM 9999-CHAINHD-DVENDOR-VN-I.
       101-CKREAD-LOOP.
           MOVE "72" TO BU-DISPLAY-PARA.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FIND-NEXT = 1
               PERFORM UNTIL VEN-ITM-NO = 0
                   PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DVENDOR-VN-I
                   IF NOT GOOD-CALL
                       GO TO 104-SPOOL-STOP
                   END-IF
               END-PERFORM
               MOVE 0         TO FIND-NEXT
           ELSE
               PERFORM 9999-GETNEXT-DVENDOR-VN-I
               IF NOT GOOD-CALL
                   GO TO 104-SPOOL-STOP.

           IF VEN-VEN-CODE = "0000000000"
               GO TO 101-CKREAD-LOOP.

           IF VEN-VEN-CODE NOT = PRESENT-VEND
               MOVE 0            TO VEN-SUB
               MOVE SPACES       TO PRINT-VENDOR-LABEL
               MOVE VEN-VEN-CODE TO PRESENT-VEND.

           ADD 1 TO VEN-SUB.
           IF VEN-SUB > 9
               MOVE 1 TO FIND-NEXT
               GO TO 101-CKREAD-LOOP.

           IF DATA1-SELECT-OPTION = "2"
               IF VEN-VEN-CODE > DATA1-HIGH-VALUE
                   GO TO 104-SPOOL-STOP.

           IF VEN-ITM-NO < 7
               MOVE VEN-ITM-DATA TO PRT-VEND-INFO (VEN-SUB)
               GO TO 101-CKREAD-LOOP
           ELSE
           IF VEN-ITM-NO = 7
               DISPLAY "PRINTED VENDOR CODE -" VEN-VEN-CODE
      *
      * 920-FIND-POSITION RETURNS THE POSITION TO PRINT THE NEXT ITEM
      * IN PRINT-POSITION
      *
                   IF ZIP-BEFORE-CITY

      *
      * ZIP CITY
      *
                     SET SAVE-ZIP-BEFORE-CITY TO TRUE
                     MOVE VEN-ZIP TO FIND-POSITION
                     PERFORM 920-FIND-POSITION
                     STRING VEN-CITY
                       DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO FIND-POSITION
                       WITH POINTER PRINT-POSITION
                     MOVE VEN-STATE-CODE TO SAVE-STATE-CODE
                     MOVE VEN-PROV-CODE TO SAVE-PROV-CODE

                   ELSE

      *
      * CITY STATE PROVINCE
      *
                     SET SAVE-ZIP-AFTER-COUNTRY TO TRUE
                     MOVE VEN-CITY TO FIND-POSITION
                     PERFORM 920-FIND-POSITION
                     STRING VEN-STATE-CODE
                       DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO FIND-POSITION
                       WITH POINTER PRINT-POSITION
                     PERFORM 920-FIND-POSITION
                     STRING VEN-PROV-CODE
                       DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO FIND-POSITION
                       WITH POINTER PRINT-POSITION
                     MOVE VEN-ZIP TO SAVE-ZIP

                   END-IF
                   MOVE FIND-POSITION TO PRT-VEND-INFO (VEN-SUB)
                   GO TO 101-CKREAD-LOOP

           ELSE
           IF VEN-ITM-NO > 7
             IF SAVE-ZIP-BEFORE-CITY
      *
      * STATE PROV COUNTRY
      *
               MOVE SAVE-STATE-CODE TO FIND-POSITION
               PERFORM 920-FIND-POSITION
               STRING SAVE-PROV-CODE
                 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO FIND-POSITION
                 WITH POINTER PRINT-POSITION
               PERFORM 920-FIND-POSITION
               STRING VEN-COUNTRY
                 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO FIND-POSITION
                 WITH POINTER PRINT-POSITION

             ELSE
      *
      * COUNTRY ZIP
      *
               MOVE VEN-COUNTRY TO FIND-POSITION
               PERFORM 920-FIND-POSITION
               STRING SAVE-ZIP DELIMITED BY SIZE
                 INTO FIND-POSITION WITH POINTER PRINT-POSITION

             END-IF
             MOVE FIND-POSITION TO PRT-VEND-INFO (VEN-SUB)
             PERFORM 5-PRINT-LABEL THRU 5-PL-X
             MOVE 1 TO FIND-NEXT
             GO TO 101-CKREAD-LOOP.

       104-SPOOL-STOP.
           PERFORM 3-STOP-SPOOL.
       10-CL-X.
           EXIT.

      *
      * PARAGRAPH TO FIND THE POSITION TO PRINT THE NEXT ITEM IN
      *
       920-FIND-POSITION.
           MOVE TOTAL-LENGTH TO PRINT-POSITION.
           PERFORM UNTIL PRINT-POSITION < 1 OR
                         CHAR-POS(PRINT-POSITION) NOT EQUAL SPACE
             SUBTRACT 1 FROM PRINT-POSITION
           END-PERFORM.
           IF PRINT-POSITION < 1
             MOVE 1 TO PRINT-POSITION
           ELSE
             ADD 2 TO PRINT-POSITION
           END-IF.

       9999-DB-CALLS SECTION.
       996-OVERRIDE-PRINT-FILE.
      *****************************************************************
      * OVERRIDE THE PRINT FILE TO PASSED PRINT FILE NUM. IF THAT
      * DOESNT EXIST, USE DEFAULT OUTQ FROM LOCAL DATA AREA. IF THE
      * OUTQ DOESN'T EXIST, DEFAULT TO 'MCPRT' PRINT FILE (OUTQ=*JOB)
      ********************************************************
           CALL "COVRPRT" USING OVRPRTF-PARMS.
           CALL "QCMDEXC" USING OVRPRTF-PARM1, OVRPRTF-PARM2.

       9930-LOCK.
       9940-UNLOCK.
       9970-STARTSPOOL.
           MOVE "*YES"    TO OVRPRTF-SHARED.
           MOVE SPOOL-PRT TO OVRPRTF-TOFILE-NUM.
           PERFORM 996-OVERRIDE-PRINT-FILE.

       9971-STOPSPOOL.
            MOVE "DLTOVR FILE(MCPRT)" TO COMMAND.
            CALL "QCMDEXC" USING COMMAND-WORK, COMMAND-LEN.

       9999-OPEN-STUFF.
           OPEN INPUT DVENDOR-VN-I.

       9999-CLOSE-STUFF.
           CLOSE      DVENDOR-VN-I.

       9999-CHAINHD-DVENDOR-VN-I.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE VEN-ARG TO VENCDE OF DVENDOR-VN-REC-I.
      *--------- START >= INSTEAD OF = VEN-ARG.
           START DVENDOR-VN-I KEY >= VENCDE OF DVENDOR-VN-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF (FILE-STATUS NOT = "00") AND (FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2")
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
                MOVE "CHAINHD ERR 9999-CHAINHD-DVENDOR-VN-I"
                    TO BU-MSG-AREA
                PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

       9999-GETNEXT-DVENDOR-VN-I.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DVENDOR-VN-I NEXT INTO BUF-DVENDOR
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
                   MOVE "GETNEXT ERR 9999-GETNEXT-DVENDOR-VN-I"
                       TO BU-MSG-AREA
                   PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP
               END-IF
           END-IF.

